<input type="hidden" id="project_branch" name="project_data[branch]"  value="master"/>
<input type="hidden" id="project_script" name="project_data[command]" value="rspec"/>
<input type="hidden" id="project_public" name="project_data[public]"  value="0"/>

<div class="form-group col-lg-12">
  <label for="project_name"><%= "Name #{errors_on(@project, :name)}" %></label>
  <input class="text" id="project_name" name="project_data[name]" type="text" value="<%= @project.name %>"/>
</div>
<div class="form-group col-lg-12">
  <label for="project_repository"><%= "Repository URI #{errors_on(@project, :uri)}" %></label>
  <input class="text" id="project_repository" name="project_data[uri]" type="text" value="<%= @project.uri %>"/>
  <ul>
    <li>
      For <b>public</b> repos, use the https://github.com/ORG/REPO.git URI format.
    </li>
    <li>
      For <b>private</b> repos, use the git://github.com/ORG/REPO format.
    </li>
    <li>
      Otherwise Honesy won't notice your pushes.
    </li>
    <li>
      If the project you are adding requires a datastore, you can't set that through this form yet. Look on AskBot.
    </li>
  </ul>
</div>
